---
description: Live Show tab — performance UX and cue strips
globs: "**/LiveShow*.swift,**/LiveShowCueStrips*.swift"
---

- Lighting/backdrop cue strips sit under the Metal preview in both normal and Performance mode; `RemoteControlSettings.lightingPerformanceStripEnabled` / `backdropPerformanceStripEnabled` default on and toggle which rows render.
- Scene strip uses `SceneCueStripView`; lighting/backdrop strips use `LiveShowCueStripsView` and `AppModel` cue APIs.
- Do not block the Metal preview with heavy inspectors on this screen.
